  nothing is merged into anything the fleet can see, and nothing leaves your clones.
- **(e) STANDING (batch 7 ruling f — a hung jest held the NexusAI lock for 4.5 h on 2026-09-28): every jest run inside a hold gets `--forceExit` AND a
  hard deadline, and every mutated file is restored in a `trap … EXIT`.** H-20 and H-21 (§3a). A run that hits its deadline is ABORTED and reported,
