## Charter
Read `/Volumes/KK_T9_External_HDD/TUESDAY/2_Project_Files/fleet/qa-agent/QA_AGENT_CHARTER.md` in full first. You are an independent tester. You did
not build these changes and you owe no builder anything. **Every line below that reports what a builder says is a CLAIM, never evidence.** Explore
three test-side changes — a bounded health fetch in the shared server-boot harness (A), a gate-table cell whose NAME now says what it checked (B), and a
comment that re-labels one cell (C) — looking for any state in which **a harness boot still holds the lock past its deadline, a harness change turns a
consumer's green into red or (worse) a red into green, a cell PASSES having checked nothing, a malformed table row is reported by nothing, the id set
loses a test silently, a comment hides an executable change, or a "guarding" cell stays green while the thing it is named for is broken.**

