  replaced so the server never listens), `bootTimeoutMs` 3000, raced against a 20 s sleep; asserts `returnedWithin20s`, message
  `/never answered \/api\/health/`, `r.ms < 8000`, child gone. **K1** — preload `rd648-ignores-sigterm-preload.js` (records each SIGTERM, never listens),
  `bootTimeoutMs` 2000; asserts ≥1 SIGTERM survived, message has `never answered /api/health` and ` stopped. output: `, `r.ms >= 7000`, child gone.
