  (failBoot's SIGKILL line removed) → K1 red. GREEN at `fd53262`: 2/2. C-68: *"ALL 25 consumer test files of rd395-server-harness.js run on main AND on the
  branch, pass sets compared BY NAME: main 299/299, branch 301/301 … passed on main but not on the branch: 0; cells slower by more than 1 s: 0"*
  (`session-tools/s86n/rd648/consumers.txt`). Verify **4189/4189 across 253** on `e1c7b21`'s tree; rd648 + rd619 + rd568 by name 9/9
  (`session-tools/s86n/ready3/rd648-verify.log`, `rd648-named.log` — the drafter read both result lines).
- **The consumer population — MEASURED by the drafter, NOT 25:** `consumers.txt` (26 lines incl. rd648) is a plain NAME grep. By
